 tempo, rest 60-90 seconds. X4\nSecond go around, add in a 1k ski/row/run after full recovery of 4th round\n\nTest fast version of burpees the lunges and the farmers \nStart to work in tricep volume once or twice a week to warmup. Start elevating heels on squats.\n\nStart to sub in cluster (clean squat press) and weighted step ups. \n\nHeavier sled push."}],"plan":[{"focus":"Foundation — technique & base","sessions":[{"tag":"Station","title":"Technique day","ex":["SkiErg technique — 4 x 250m easy, focus on form","Sled push (light load) — 4 x 10m","Sled pull (light load) — 4 x 10m","Wall ball technique — 3 x 15 reps, light ball"]},{"tag":"Run","title":"Easy base run","ex":["20-25 min easy, conversational pace","4 x 100m relaxed strides to finish"]},{"tag":"Strength","title":"Full-body strength","ex":["Goblet squats — 3 x 12","Farmers carry — 3 x 40m moderate","Sandbag lunges — 2 x 20m light","Rowing — 3 x 250m easy","Burpees — 3 x 10"]},{"tag":"Hybrid","title":"Hybrid intro","ex":["500m row","20 wall balls","400m run","20 lunges (each leg)","400m run — easy pace, focus on transitions"]}]},{"focus":"Foundation — build volume","sessions":[{"tag":"Station","title":"Station volume","ex":["SkiErg — 5 x 300m","Sled push — 4 x 15m","Sled pull — 4 x 15m","Wall balls — 4 x 20 reps"]},{"tag":"Run","title":"Base run + strides","ex":["30 min easy","6 x 150m strides"]},{"tag":"Strength","title":"Full-body strength","ex":["Squats — 4 x 10","Farmers carry — 4 x 50m","Sandbag lunges — 3 x 25m","Rowing — 4 x 300m","Burpees — 4 x 12"]},{"tag":"Hybrid","title":"Hybrid build","ex":["750m row","30 wall balls","500m run","30 lunges","500m run","20 burpee broad jumps"]}]},{"focus":"Foundation — aerobic capacity","sessions":[{"tag":"Station","title":"Aerobic stations","ex":["SkiErg — 6 x 300m steady","Rowing — 6 x 300m steady","Wall balls — 5 x 20 reps, moderate pace"]},{"tag":"Run","title":"Long easy run","ex":["35-40 min easy, flat route","Finish with 4 x 100m strides"]},{"tag":"Strength"